      "note": "Acknowledged, not fixed. `request_data` is a generic JSON:API-style helper that permits the whole `data` payload; the controllers that consume it are responsible for whitelisting attributes before mass assignment. Tightening this into per-endpoint key allowlists is real security-hardening work tracked in issue #56 (suppression added alongside the CI setup in #55). Remove this entry when #56 lands."
